reg['policy']='Historical drawings and photographs inform manual original authoring. GameModels3D geometry is restricted to an isolated raster renderer. Production uses the versioned blueprint/catalog and original Python; no game offsets, attachment transforms, UVs, textures or geometry are authoring inputs.'
